{"additions":2164,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nFolds the standalone Actions page (key `6`, shipped in v0.7.0) into the GitHub page. Workflow runs are now a third list column next to Issues and Pull Requests, and the selected run's **Jobs** (job → steps tree) and **Log** (tail) show in the shared Detail area as sub-panes, using the same `h` / `l` / `Tab` / `Esc` mechanism as the PR detail. Worktrees moves to key / slot `6`. Read-only as before: no rerun / cancel.\n\n```\n┌ Issues ───────┬ Pull Requests ─┬ Workflow Runs ─┐\n│ …             │ …              │ ✓ CI #208 main │\n├───────────────┴────────────────┴────────────────┤\n│ Detail                                          │\n│  issue → Body / Comments                        │\n│  pr    → Body / Checks / Reviews / Comments     │\n│  run   → Jobs (job → steps) │ Log (tail)        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Runs column** — `run_list` pane: `WorkflowRun` implements `GhListItem`, so search (`/` over workflow / `#number` / branch / event), disk cache, `o` (open run in browser) and selection come from `GhListPane`. Rows keep the status icon, workflow, `#number`, branch, event, duration and age. `GhListPane` now keeps the selection on the same item across refreshes (new runs / issues / PRs are prepended).\n- **Run detail** — `GhDetailContent::Run` with `GhDetailPane::{Jobs, Log}` on the existing `GhDetailViewPane`: `h` / `l` / `Tab` / `BackTab` move between Jobs and Log, `Enter` (`OpenLog`) loads the selected job's log (a step row scrolls to that step), `]` / `[` jump between failed steps, `/` searches job and step names or log lines, `Esc` returns to the list. The former `JobsPane` / `LogPane` became `JobsView` / `LogView` sub-pane state in `panes/detail_view/{jobs,log}.rs`.\n- **Refresh** — the run list refetches on the tick every 5 s while any run is queued / in progress (same mechanism as the PR checks watch); a queued / running run's jobs and a running job's log are polled every 5 s. `r` on a run detail re-fetches its jobs and log. The status bar shows `N runs ◐ M active`.\n- **Layout** — `slot` gains a multi-case form (`slot \"detail\" default=\"issue_detail\" { when \"pr_list\" \"pr_detail\" then=\"pr_detail\"; when \"run_list\" \"run_detail\" then=\"run_detail\" }`); the single-case `then=` / `triggers` form is unchanged. Default `page \"github\"` layout: three columns of 33 / 34 / 33 % on top, the detail slot below.\n- **Fix** — the view-level `Tab` / `BackTab` (`CyclePaneForward` / `Backward`) no longer apply to panes outside the tab cycle, so the GitHub detail panes get the key and cycle their sub-panes (the PR demo's `Tab` → Reviews / Comments works again).\n- **Moved / removed** — `src/actions/domain/*` → `src/github/domain/actions/`, `panes/runs.rs` → `src/github/panes/run_list.rs`, `panes/{jobs,log}.rs` → `src/github/panes/detail_view/`; `src/actions/` (page, state), `page \"actions\"`, `\"6\" \"page:actions\"`, the `pages` entry, the `build_pages` arm, `actions_page()` + tests, the Actions header / status bar, `tape/demo-actions.tape`, `assets/demo-actions.gif` and the `demo:actions` mise task are gone.\n- **Config compatibility** — a user config listing `actions` in `pages` or binding `page:actions` fails fast with `page \"actions\" was folded into the \"github\" page (v0.8.0); remove it from pages / app bindings` (tested).\n- **Docs** — README (en / ja): Features bullet merged into GitHub View, view switching `1`–`6`, the GitHub View section gains the runs column and run-detail keys, `### Actions View` dropped; `docs/config.md` (panes / actions, `when` slot form, removed-page note); `CLAUDE.md` architecture line.\n- **Tests** — moved actions tests; new tests for the runs `GhListItem` row / search text / id identity, selection kept across refreshes, `GhDetailContent::Run` sub-pane switching, `Enter` → log, `o` fallbacks, search per sub-pane, `Tab` in a detail pane, the three-column layout / slot resolution, the `when` slot parser and its errors, the config-compat error, `pages` / app keymap `1..6`.\n- **Demo** — `tape/demo-github-pr.tape` continues into the runs column (`l` → runs, `j`, `Enter` → jobs tree, `Enter` → log, scroll / search, `h` / `Esc` back, `/release` over the runs). The GIF is recorded against this PR (td72/vig had no open PR before it) and pushed in a follow-up commit together with the tape.\n\n## Not verified\n\n- Only unit tests and the demo recording exercised the page; no long-running run was watched end-to-end (queued → in progress → completed) through the tick refresh.\n- Other pages' GIFs still show the seven-page header (`6:Actions 7:Worktrees`); the coordinator re-records everything before the release.\n\nCloses #118\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":39,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T08:43:06Z","deletions":1896,"headRefName":"feat/github-runs-column","labels":[],"number":124,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLZ8Zcg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🔵 Needs a closer look\n\nIt’s a broad refactor spanning core layout parsing, global key dispatch behavior, and major GitHub page UI/state changes, which warrants final human verification beyond static review.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR folds the standalone Actions page into the GitHub page by adding a third “Workflow Runs” list column and run-specific detail sub-panes (Jobs/Log) in the shared detail area, while removing the Actions page and updating config/docs/tests accordingly.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add a Workflow Runs list column to the GitHub page and introduce run detail content (Jobs + Log) within the existing detail view.\n- Extend layout slot resolution to support multi-case `when ... then=...` rules and update default GitHub layout/bindings to use them.\n- Remove the Actions page (code, config, demo assets/tasks) and add fast-fail config errors for legacy `actions` page references; update docs and tests to match.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/demo-actions.tape | Removes the Actions demo tape since the page is removed. |\r\n| src/pages.rs | Drops Actions page construction from the page registry. |\r\n| src/main.rs | Removes the `actions` module declaration. |\r\n| src/github/state.rs | Adds run list/detail panes, tick-refresh behavior for active runs, and routes run background messages into GitHub state. |\r\n| src/github/panes/run_list.rs | Introduces the Workflow Runs list pane (rendering, search text, disk cache, fetch, and selection retention). |\r\n| src/github/panes/mod.rs | Registers the new `run_list` pane module. |\r\n| src/github/panes/gh_list.rs | Enhances list pane selection retention across refresh and exposes `selected_item()`. |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/view.rs | Adds rendering for run detail (header + Jobs/Log sub-panes) and run header formatting. |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/mod.rs | Adds `GhDetailContent::Run`, run-specific detail actions, and run Jobs/Log sub-pane state wiring (polling, search, open log). |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/log.rs | Refactors the former log pane into a reusable `LogView` sub-pane for run detail. |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/jobs.rs | Refactors the former jobs pane into a reusable `JobsView` sub-pane for run detail, including polling logic. |\r\n| src/github/domain/mod.rs | Adds `github::domain::actions` module under GitHub domain. |\r\n| src/github/domain/actions/types.rs | Retitles/repurposes Actions types as GitHub page workflow-run data types. |\r\n| src/github/domain/actions/time.rs | Adds time utilities (ISO8601 parsing, durations, relative time labels) for run UI. |\r\n| src/github/domain/actions/mod.rs | Introduces the Actions domain module under `src/github/domain/actions/`. |\r\n| src/github/domain/actions/log.rs | Repoints log parsing helpers to the new GitHub actions time module. |\r\n| src/github/domain/actions/client.rs | Rehomes `gh run` wrappers and cache helpers under GitHub actions domain. |\r\n| src/git/state.rs | Updates slot-rule test helpers to the new multi-case slot rule structure. |\r\n| src/core/ui/status_bar.rs | Removes Actions status UI and extends GitHub status bar to include run counts and run-detail loading. |\r\n| src/core/pane.rs | Adjusts Tab/BackTab cycling behavior to respect the tab cycle and allow GitHub detail panes to consume those keys. |\r\n| src/core/layout.rs | Adds multi-case slot rules (`SlotCase`) and updates slot resolution logic + tests. |\r\n| src/core/config/loader.rs | Removes Actions page config loader, adds legacy-page fast-fail messaging, and parses single-/multi-case slot syntax. |\r\n| src/core/app.rs | Updates page labels/keys/help to remove Actions and shift Worktrees to slot/key 6. |\r\n| src/actions/state.rs | Deletes Actions page state implementation (page removed). |\r\n| src/actions/panes/runs.rs | Deletes Actions runs pane (moved into GitHub page). |\r\n| src/actions/panes/mod.rs | Deletes Actions panes module (page removed). |\r\n| src/actions/page.rs | Deletes Actions page constructor (page removed). |\r\n| src/actions/mod.rs | Deletes Actions module entrypoint (page removed). |\r\n| src/actions/domain/mod.rs | Deletes Actions domain module entrypoint (moved under GitHub). |\r\n| README.md | Updates feature list, key table, and GitHub view docs to include workflow runs; removes Actions view section. |\r\n| mise.toml | Removes the `demo:actions` task and drops it from `demo:all`. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Mirrors README updates in Japanese: workflow runs in GitHub view; removes Actions view. |\r\n| docs/config.md | Removes Actions page references, documents new slot `when` form, and updates pane/action tables accordingly. |\r\n| CLAUDE.md | Updates architecture notes to reflect workflow runs being part of GitHub page. |\r\n| assets/demo-actions.gif | Removes the Actions demo GIF asset (page removed). |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Removes Actions page config, adds GitHub `run_list` / `run_detail`, multi-case `slot` rules, and updates page list/app keys. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 35/36 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c3572279ad3e978093867ae85ecf875b2e757642"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLZ9KHQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nRun detail search highlights can become stale/incorrect when switching between Jobs and Log sub-panes because search state is shared at the pane level but match indices are sub-pane-specific.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 38/39 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-08-30T08:54:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"30079679cb47b10d0335c35eea6e15c73b89db81"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:09Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302872958/job/99234143171","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:19Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:00Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504526/job/99233119294","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:49:15Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504570/job/99233119533","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:49:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504526/job/99233119426","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:50Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:08Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504526/job/99233119392","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:08Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504526/job/99233272524","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:50:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:09Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302872958/job/99234126432","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:49:29Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504570/job/99233119486","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:49:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302504570/job/99233119372","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:48:47Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:09Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33302872958/job/99234141000","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-08-30T08:58:17Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"♻️ GitHub view: workflow runs as a third column, Actions page removed"}
